          "title": "You'll want to know: ಕೇಂದ್ರೀಕರಿಸು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೇಂದ್ರೀಕರಿಸು — kēndrīkarisu — \"to focus\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪರೀಕ್ಷೆಗೆ ಮೊದಲು ನಾನು ಗಣಿತದ ಮೇಲೆ ಗಮನ ಕೇಂದ್ರೀಕರಿಸಿದೆ. parīkṣege modalu nānu gaṇitada mēle gamana kēndrīkariside. Before the exam I focused on mathematics."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಕೇಂದ್ರೀಕರಿಸಿದೆ, kēndrīkariside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What you focus on takes ಮೇಲೆ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೇಂದ್ರೀಕರಿಸು (kēndrīkarisu) is built on Sanskrit kendra, \"the centre of a circle\" (Monier-Williams), itself taken from Greek kentron, with -īkarisu, \"to make into\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
